      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span style=&#34;background-color: rgb(213, 114, 43); font-weight: bold;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9; 数据 Data &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Film Database: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/juneleung/FilmDatabase/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/juneleung/FilmDatabase/&lt;/a&gt;     @Juneleung&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;filmtypes: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.filmtypes.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://www.filmtypes.com/&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span style=&#34;background-color: rgb(213, 114, 43); font-weight: bold;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9; 胶片模拟 Emulation &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SIGGRAPH 2010 - Color Enhancement and Rendering in Film and Game Production - Film Simulation for Video Games - Yoshiharu Gotanda &lt;a href=&#34;https://renderwonk.com/publications/s2010-color-course/gotanda/slide_film_simulation_for_videogames.pdf&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://renderwonk.com/publications/s2010-color-course/gotanda/slide_film_simulation_for_videogames.pdf&lt;/a&gt;    &#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://renderwonk.com/publications/s2010-color-course/gotanda/course_note_film_simulation_for_videogames.pdf&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://renderwonk.com/publications/s2010-color-course/gotanda/course_note_film_simulation_for_videogames.pdf&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Realistic Film Grain Rendering &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.lirmm.fr/~nfaraj/publications/film_grain_ipol/2017_Newson_film_grain.pdf&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://www.lirmm.fr/~nfaraj/publications/film_grain_ipol/2017_Newson_film_grain.pdf&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;AI FilterSimulation &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/fg0521/filter4free&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;https://github.com/fg0521/filter4free&lt;/a&gt;     @柴师傅在打工&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;